and its FF/GG/HH/F/G/H/ROTATE_LEFT macros) is additionally derived
from the RSA Data Security, Inc. MD4 Message-Digest Algorithm and is
subject to the following notice (per the RSA-MD identifier in the
SPDX-License-Identifier of the upstream FreeBSD source):

